{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba tests/check_invocation_log/test_check_invocation_log_entry.sh | sed -n '430,620p'\"","aggregated_output":"   430\t\n   431\t## Invocation log entry\n   432\t\n   433\t~~~markdown\n   434\t### 2026-05-09T00:00:00Z — jrnb2024/pim@main\n   435\t\n   436\t- **Operator:** @tester\n   437\t~~~\n   438\tEOF\n   439\t  commit_case \"$repo_dir\" \"case 14\"\n   440\t  run_case \"$repo_dir\" 0 'OK: cascade-status=onboarded; 2 checks passed' ''\n   441\t\n   442\t  repo_dir=\"$TMPDIR/case15\"\n   443\t  init_case_repo \"$repo_dir\"\n   444\t  cat >\"$repo_dir/DISPATCH-NOTE.md\" <<'EOF'\n   445\tcascade-status: onboarded\n   446\tcascade-status: onboarded-operator-bump\n   447\t- **Target:** jrnb2024/pim\n   448\tEOF\n   449\t  commit_case \"$repo_dir\" \"case 15\"\n   450\t  run_case \"$repo_dir\" 1 '' 'ERROR: expected exactly one cascade-status match, found 2: onboarded, onboarded-operator-bump'\n   451\t\n   452\t  repo_dir=\"$TMPDIR/case16\"\n   453\t  init_case_repo \"$repo_dir\"\n   454\t  cat >\"$repo_dir/DISPATCH-NOTE.md\" <<'EOF'\n   455\tcascade-status: onboarded\n   456\t- **Target:** jrnb2024/pim\n   457\tEOF\n   458\t  cat >\"$repo_dir/docs/reviews/WP-SCP-020/branch-protection-log.md\" <<'EOF'\n   459\t---\n   460\t\n   461\t## Invocation log entry\n   462\t\n   463\t~~~markdown\n   464\t### 2026-05-09T00:00:00Z — jrnb2024/pim@main\n   465\t\n   466\t- **Operator:** @tester\n   467\t~~~\n   468\tEOF\n   469\t  fake_gh_dir=\"$TMPDIR/fake-gh-case16\"\n   470\t  mkdir -p \"$fake_gh_dir\"\n   471\t  cat >\"$fake_gh_dir/gh\" <<'EOF'\n   472\t#!/usr/bin/env bash\n   473\tset -euo pipefail\n   474\t\n   475\tcase \"$*\" in\n   476\t  \"pr view 99 --json body --jq .body\")\n   477\t    exit 0\n   478\t    ;;\n   479\t  \"pr diff 99 --name-only\")\n   480\t    printf '%s\\n' \\\n   481\t      \"docs/reviews/WP-SCP-020/branch-protection-log.md\" \\\n   482\t      \"oth